{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/713480-state-of-scion-2nd-ed","id":713480,"title":"State of Scion 2nd Ed","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-21T19:27:00-07:00","id":713480,"title":"State of Scion 2nd Ed","content":"Okay... trying to dig through pages of threads (not to mention threads with many pages) for any relevant information on where we are at with Scion 2nd Ed is quickly becoming the proverbial needle in a haystack (and the Search function doesn't seem to be narrowing it down much). So I thought I would come right out and ask the question...<br /> <br /> Where exactly are we on getting Scion 2nd Ed?<br /> <br /> I am rather curious as I am considering starting up a Scion game soon and was wondering if I should postpone it until 2nd Ed is out (maybe going with a different game for a bit)... or just continue as planned until it comes out and then convert over (provided it is realistically plausible to do so).<br /> <br /> I have seen no mention of any Kick Starter projects with Scion yet... will there be one or did I miss it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T21:57:06-07:00","id":713683,"title":"","content":"It seems a bit far out from when Scion 2e is going to be ready. Storypath, the new Onyx Path in-house system, that Scion and Trinity will be running on is still noted as being in development. So until that's done, I doubt Scion 2e will be ready to go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T22:08:53-07:00","id":713696,"title":"","content":"There was a link to some storypath stuff in the Trinity Continuum forum, so stuff is proceeding. Plus Neall is still answering questions in the Ask Neall thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T03:14:45-07:00","id":714076,"title":"","content":"Not quite the answers I was hoping for (given that EX3 seems to be almost here... at least the PDFs... Backers seem to be getting it this week or next), but is nice to know that there is at least progress being made.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T08:16:26-07:00","id":714599,"title":"","content":"Ex3 doesn't use the Storypath system, so its readiness is largely irrelevant to Scion 2e moving along (save maybe certain writers having more free time).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T09:12:10-07:00","id":714677,"title":"","content":"Right now I'm prepping the outline for the Scion alpha, which should be ready by Midwinter Con. The Origins and Hero outlines are currently being written. I'd ballpark it at about 8-9 months to a Kickstarter-ready state if all goes well (which it will not), though obviously the exact timing of the KS depends on Onyx Path's preferences and priorities, not mine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T11:11:27-07:00","id":714803,"title":"","content":"Yeah, there are a few writers in common, but there's really no connection between Ex3 and <i>Scion</i> in terms of development and release schedule.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T11:52:24-07:00","id":714942,"title":"","content":"What I meant with the Ex3 comment was simply that I started hearing about 2nd Ed Scion about the same time as work was beginning on Ex3... and since they were being developed by different teams, I merely thought that things would be further along with Scion 2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T20:32:55-07:00","id":717082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/713480-state-of-scion-2nd-ed?p=714677#post714677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Right now I'm prepping the outline for the Scion alpha, which should be ready by Midwinter Con. The Origins and Hero outlines are currently being written. I'd ballpark it at about 8-9 months to a Kickstarter-ready state if all goes well (which it will not), though obviously the exact timing of the KS depends on Onyx Path's preferences and priorities, not mine.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you guys gonna do any open testing for Scion or a way to apply to be a tester?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2448-dante","name":"Dante","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2448_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-25T17:31:49-07:00","id":727491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowstripe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/713480-state-of-scion-2nd-ed?p=714942#post714942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What I meant with the Ex3 comment was simply that I started hearing about 2nd Ed Scion about the same time as work was beginning on Ex3... and since they were being developed by different teams, I merely thought that things would be further along with Scion 2.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even then it was mentioned that Scion &amp; the Trinity Continuum were projects they would invest upon only after Ex3 came out. It's coming out just as we speak (backer version is out, but open PDF and dead tree issue still to go), so they can finally seriously <b>start </b>to think about it, <b>right now</b>.<br /> <br /> Not expecting a drag like we had for Ex3, but also not betting on anything before 6 months to an year.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T22:50:38-07:00","id":733954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/713480-state-of-scion-2nd-ed?p=727491#post727491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Even then it was mentioned that Scion &amp; the Trinity Continuum were projects they would invest upon only after Ex3 came out. It's coming out just as we speak (backer version is out, but open PDF and dead tree issue still to go), so they can finally seriously <b>start </b>to think about it, <b>right now</b>.<br /> <br /> Not expecting a drag like we had for Ex3, but also not betting on anything before 6 months to an year.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah... that part wasn't something I particularly paying attention to at the time... and given how long it has taken to get Ex3 to this point it probably wasn't going to be a fact I would have remembered anyways (yes... like the majority of people... I tend to zone out after the words &quot;2nd Edition coming soon&quot;).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T11:18:58-07:00","id":735353,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowstripe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/713480-state-of-scion-2nd-ed?p=733954#post733954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah... that part wasn't something I particularly paying attention to at the time... and given how long it has taken to get Ex3 to this point it probably wasn't going to be a fact I would have remembered anyways (yes... like the majority of people... I tend to zone out after the words &quot;2nd Edition coming soon&quot;).</div> </div> </div> </div>We're not going to do a Kickstarter until after the book is at least 90 percent, and you'll be able to read it beforehand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T21:36:56-07:00","id":736864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/713480-state-of-scion-2nd-ed?p=714677#post714677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Right now I'm prepping the outline for the Scion alpha, which should be ready by Midwinter Con. The Origins and Hero outlines are currently being written. I'd ballpark it at about 8-9 months to a Kickstarter-ready state if all goes well (which it will not), though obviously the exact timing of the KS depends on Onyx Path's preferences and priorities, not mine.</div> </div> </div> </div>When you say &quot;alpha&quot; is that something in house only? or is it more akin to like the early early days of the D&amp;D Next playtest, something to float to more people with a big provision &quot;SUBJECT TO CHANGE!!!&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-29T05:11:44-07:00","id":737731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/713480-state-of-scion-2nd-ed?p=736864#post736864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When you say &quot;alpha&quot; is that something in house only? or is it more akin to like the early early days of the D&amp;D Next playtest, something to float to more people with a big provision &quot;SUBJECT TO CHANGE!!!&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably a bit of both. The Sardonyx document that will be released will have a giant preface denoting the writer-facing language; it's an internal document, not a full-fledged playtest. The Scion alpha is built off of that, so we can codify and identify the systems we need to create.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-29T19:34:14-07:00","id":740618,"title":"","content":"*Storypath","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T07:52:02-07:00","id":741753,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/713480-state-of-scion-2nd-ed?p=740618#post740618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*Storypath</div> </div> </div> </div><u><i><b>NEVER</b></i></u><br /> <br /> (yes, it's Storypath)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T23:44:00-07:00","id":743905,"title":"","content":"I'm guessing that since you are projecting about 8-9 months until a Kickstarter (provided nothing unexpected happens... which it probably will) that you have at least some of a rough draft complete. You projected that such a Kickstarter wouldn't happen until around 90% complete... so I am curious as to where about you feel the project currently is... 10%... 25%... more? I understand that this would probably be an inaccurate guess as things are likely to change once they get going... and that sometimes one has to take a few steps back before they can move forward again.<br /> <br /> I do hope that there will be a bit more variety in the kinds of boons the various Purviews will be getting so that two Scions with the same Purview don't end up being carbon copies of each other (more work for you, yes... but many players would likely appreciate it). Can't wait until you can start sharing some of the cool ideas the team is cooking up for these new books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-31T12:47:43-07:00","id":744907,"title":"","content":"I do hope you guys finish Scion 2e faster than Exalted 3e (though considering my history with Scion all it has to do is not explode 5 sessions in and the game is done enough for me). I do like what I read about Storypath's mechanics, reminded me of Storyteller mixed with Cortex Plus. Any chances we'll see more documentation in the near future?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-31T14:02:38-07:00","id":745057,"title":"","content":"I'm curious as to what has been said about Stroypath mechanics so far... got any links?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-31T17:14:51-07:00","id":745356,"title":"","content":"Shadowstripe: If you go to the Onyx Path site's front page and click on &quot;Scion&quot; at the top, then scroll down to the news posts, you'll see three [Codename: Sardonyx] posts. Each of those contain a teaser for Storypath.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum